    20	\title{Can the Other Side Steer Your AI Lawyer?\\
    21	\large Prompt Injection, Framing and Record Manipulation in AI Legal Review}
    22	\author{Jay Cho\thanks{The author is a practising solicitor admitted in New South Wales, Australia.
