   157	Core, capped & Fable 5.1 (Claude Code CLI) & 10 \\
   158	Breadth & Sonnet 5.5, Opus 4.8 (Claude Code CLI); GPT-6.1 Terra, GPT-6 Astra, GPT-6 Sol,
   159	          GPT-5.6 Sol, GPT-5.6 Terra, GPT-5.6 Luna (Codex CLI) & 5 \\
